{"3096450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Decaying Salvage", "steam_appid": 3096450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096450/extras/e22d98326d01d3f884f8e40915621e7f.avif?t=1787725131\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jordan's ship is failing. Around her is an impossible sight, a graveyard of abandoned starships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she wants to return to Earth ... she'll have to board them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096450/extras/880b19d2a27a82e8bef68c1dd6d37ff8.poster.avif?t=1787725131\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096450/extras/880b19d2a27a82e8bef68c1dd6d37ff8.webm?t=1787725131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096450/extras/880b19d2a27a82e8bef68c1dd6d37ff8.mp4?t=1787725131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096450/extras/dbc5de9ae62bb402fb34ce9c18ec8e4a.avif?t=1787725131\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore derelict vessels for the components you need. Solve puzzles, unlock new sections and locate the supplies you need. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096450/extras/945967ae9b0d74be5c7056759ab3b7b2.poster.avif?t=1787725131\" width=1066 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096450/extras/945967ae9b0d74be5c7056759ab3b7b2.webm?t=1787725131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096450/extras/945967ae9b0d74be5c7056759ab3b7b2.mp4?t=1787725131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096450/extras/91b32ca85284b08e45f4a24fb284b9c3.avif?t=1787725131\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each ship hides unique dangers. Ammunition is scarce, supplies are limited. Choose when to fight, and when to run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096450/extras/d11ea13715c7f552d92c6cdaeff3d0b5.poster.avif?t=1787725131\" width=972 height=628 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096450/extras/d11ea13715c7f552d92c6cdaeff3d0b5.webm?t=1787725131\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096450/extras/d11ea13715c7f552d92c6cdaeff3d0b5.mp4?t=1787725131\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3096450/extras/68a5cef8c4501d7343cc5bc0b410a9af.avif?t=1787725131\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fixed camera angles, exploration, puzzles, inventory management and interconnected environments inspired by the survival horror classics.</p